# Build/lint contract, synced from the proof vault.
# NEVER tracked: its notes and evidence_path fields carry real client business
# names, and GitHub Pages serves every tracked file. Anonymised labels are what
# the rendered site publishes; this is the private source behind them.
proof/greenlit.json

# Screenshots of INTERNAL surfaces. Added 2026-08-25 after
# assets/shot-creative-review-*.webp shipped three complete, legible generation
# prompts to a public URL. The review site itself was correctly password-gated;
# a screenshot of it was tracked here and served HTTP 200 beside it. No text
# search could have caught it, because the leak was a picture.
#
# GitHub Pages serves every tracked file. Before adding any screenshot of an
# admin panel, dashboard, CRM, ad manager or internal tool, OPEN IT AT FULL SIZE
# AND READ IT. A grep cannot do this for you.
assets/shot-*-review-*.webp
assets/shot-*-internal-*.webp
assets/**/_quarantine*/
